  "title": "Mom's Carne Guisada",
  "description": "Bite-sized chunks of round steak are sauteed with cumin and garlic, then simmered in flour-thickened sauce with onions and bell peppers. Good over rice, noodles, or in burritos.",
  "authors": [
    "Brenda Espinoza"
  ],
